    rdfs:comment "Displays the connection status: RUNNING A statement is executing. IDLE No statements are currently executing on this connection. QUEUEING The connection is currently queued. The status changes to RUNNING when it is dequeued (this depends on the system's resource consumption). EMPTY A historic connection that is removed after 1 hour. The removal time can be configured in `indexserver.ini [session] connection_history_lifetime = 60 # minutes`." .

