sup:Column_M_DATA_STATISTICS__DATA_STATISTICS_CONTENT a sup:Column ;
    rdfs:label "DATA_STATISTICS_CONTENT column of M_DATA_STATISTICS" ;
    sup:columnName "DATA_STATISTICS_CONTENT" ;
    sup:columnOf sup:View_M_DATA_STATISTICS ;
    sup:dataType "NCLOB (max size 2Gb)" ;
    rdfs:comment "Lists the content and properties of the data statistics object as of the last refresh (JSON format). The content section is empty for SIMPLE, SKETCH, and RECORD COUNT; it contains bucket boundaries and counts for HISTOGRAM and a values and frequencies list for TOPK. For SAMPLE, it contains a list of sample output. The content is similar to exported data for data statistics objects. The properties section contains properties relevant to the data statistics of the specified type. The properties section, when present, may include some of the following properties: MEMORY Displays the memory size used by the data statistics object in bytes MEMORY PERCENT Displays the memory size used by the data statistics object, as a percentage of the data source size COUNT Displays the number of rows in the data source DISTINCT COUNT Displays the number of unique values in the data source NULL COUNT Displays the number of NULL values in the data source BUCKETS Displays the number of buckets in the data statistics object QERROR Displays the value of the qerror parameter used for building the data statistics object QTHETA Displays the value of the qtheta parameter used for building the data statistics object ACCURACY Displays the accuracy parameter used for building the data statistics object PREFIX BITS Displays the prefix bits parameter used for building the data statistics object MIN VALUE Displays the minimum value in the data source in bytes MAX VALUE Displays the maximum value in the data source in bytes MAX_ROWID Displays the maximum rowID for the data statistics object MIN MAX IS VALID Displays whether MIN/MAX values are valid SAMPLE SIZE Displays the sample size at build time, expressed in bytes SAMPLE SIZE PERCENT Displays the sample size at build time, expressed as a percent of the data volume" .

sup:Column_M_DATA_STATISTICS__DATA_STATISTICS_NAME a sup:Column ;
    rdfs:label "DATA_STATISTICS_NAME column of M_DATA_STATISTICS" ;
    sup:columnName "DATA_STATISTICS_NAME" ;
