    sup:dataType "NVARCHAR(16)" ;
    rdfs:comment "Displays the active status. This column contains the following values: - NO - Displays that the service has not started. - YES - Displays that the service has started and is ready for requests. - UNKNOWN - Displays the initial state after starting a landscape, or when the state is not known (for example, after a crash). If the service does not start within a minute, this state changes to NO. - STARTING - Displays that the service is starting. This state might last for several minutes on first startup or recovery. - STOPPING - Displays that the service is stopping." .

