    sup:columnName "DATA_STATISTICS_CONTENT" ;
    sup:columnOf sup:View_M_SYSTEM_DATA_STATISTICS ;
    sup:dataType "NCLOB" ;
    rdfs:comment "Lists the content and properties of the data statistics object as of the last refresh (JSON format). The content section is empty for SIMPLE; it contains values and frequencies in a list for TOPK. For SAMPLE, it contains a list of sample output. The content is similar to exported data for data statistics objects. The properties section contains properties relevant to the data statistics of the specified type. The properties section, when present, may include some of the following properties: BUCKETS Displays the number of buckets in the data statistics object COUNT Displays the number of rows in the data source DISTINCT COUNT Displays the number of unique values in the data source NULL COUNT Displays the number of NULL values in the data source MIN VALUE Displays the minimum value in the data source in bytes MAX VALUE Displays the maximum value in the data source in bytes MIN MAX IS VALID Displays whether MIN/MAX values are valid SAMPLE SIZE Displays the sample size at build time, expressed as a number" .

